// Control case: uses proj_default (test 01, built WITH label indexes).
// A label-filtered MATCH uses the label_node index. This query must work
// and return all 5 users. Its presence alongside tests 04/05 and the bad
// queries proves the flag flips behavior: with labels it works, without
// labels it throws the QueryException (see bad_queries/01).
USE proj_default
MATCH (n:User)
RETURN count(*) AS labeled_nodes
